  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "けいかいしんが　つよい。　ひるは\nこうごうせいで　ちからを　ためて\nよるに　なったら　かつどうかいし。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "경계심이 강하다. 낮에는\n광합성으로 힘을 비축하고\n밤이 되면 활동을 개시한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "警戒心很強。\n白天利用光合作用積蓄力量，\n到了夜晚才開始活動。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ce Pokémon ne baisse jamais sa garde.\nPendant la journée, il accumule de l’énergie par\nphotosynthèse, pour mieux agir la nuit venue.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ein wachsames und nachtaktives Pokémon.\nTagsüber sammelt es per Photosynthese\nKräfte, um fit für die Nacht zu sein.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es cauteloso, desconfiado y de naturaleza\nnocturna. Durante el día acumula energía\nmediante la fotosíntesis.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Questo Pokémon è sempre all’erta.\nDi giorno accumula energia tramite fotosintesi\nper poi passare all’azione di notte.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "This wary Pokémon uses photosynthesis to\nstore up energy during the day, while becoming\nactive at night.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "警戒心が　強い。　昼は\n光合成で　力を　溜めて\n夜になったら　活動開始。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "戒备心很强。\n白天利用光合作用积蓄力量，\n到了晚上就开始活动。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es cauteloso, desconfiado y de naturaleza\nnocturna. Durante el día acumula energía\nmediante la fotosíntesis.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "いっさい　おとを　たてず　かっくうし\nてきに　きゅうせっきん。　きづかぬまに\nきょうれつな　けりを　あびせる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "전혀 소리를 내지 않고 활공하여\n적에게 빠르게 접근한다. 눈치채기 전에\n강렬한 발차기를 퍼붓는다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "能不發出一絲聲響地滑翔，\n極速接近敵人。在對方還未發覺時，\n使出猛烈的腳踢來攻擊。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il s’approche de ses ennemis en glissant dans\nles airs sans faire le moindre bruit, puis leur\nassène de puissants coups de patte.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Nachdem es sich seinem Feind lautlos\nim Gleitflug genähert hat, wird dieser mit\nheftigen Tritten völlig überrascht.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se aproxima a sus enemigos planeando por el\naire sin hacer el menor ruido y les propina unas\npatadas de lo más poderosas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Si avvicina ai nemici ignari planando su di loro\nsenza produrre il minimo rumore e li tempesta\ndi poderosi calci.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Silently it glides, drawing near its targets. Before\nthey even notice it, it begins to pelt them with\nvicious kicks.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "一切　音を　立てず　滑空し\n敵に　急接近。　気づかぬ間に\n強烈な　蹴りを　浴びせる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "不发出一丝声响地滑翔，\n急速接近敌人。在对方还未发觉时，\n就使出猛烈的脚踢。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se aproxima a sus enemigos planeando por el\naire sin hacer el menor ruido y les propina unas\npatadas de lo más poderosas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "はものの　ように　するどい　はねを\nとばして　こうげき。　あしのちからも\nつよく　キックも　あなどれないのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "칼같이 날카로운 날개를 날려\n공격한다. 발의 힘도 강해\n킥도 무시할 수 없다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "能射出刀刃般鋒利的羽毛\n進行攻擊。雙腳的力量也很強，\n腳踢的威力同樣不能小看。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il attaque en tirant des plumes acérées.\nLa force de ses coups de patte est également\nredoutable.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es schleudert messerscharfe Federn auf seine\nGegner. Aber auch seine Tritte sind nicht zu\nunterschätzen, denn es hat sehr kräftige Beine.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Usa sus afiladas plumas como arma arrojadiza\ny la fuerza de sus patas le permite asestar\npoderosas patadas que es mejor no subestimar.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Attacca lanciando piume affilate come lame e\npuò anche tirare poderosi calci con le zampe\nrobuste.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It sends its feathers, which are as sharp as\nblades, flying in attack. Its legs are strong,\nso its kicks are also formidable.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "刃物の　ように　鋭い　羽を\n飛ばして　攻撃。　足の力も\n強く　キックも　侮れないのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "射出像刀刃般锐利的羽毛进行攻击。\n脚上的力量也很强，\n脚踢也不可小觑。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Usa sus afiladas plumas como arma arrojadiza\ny la fuerza de sus patas le permite asestar\npoderosas patadas que es mejor no subestimar.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "せまくて　くらいばしょが　おちつく。\nトレーナーの　ふところや　バッグを\nすの　かわりに　することも　あるぞ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "좁고 어두운 곳을 편안해한다.\n트레이너의 품이나 가방을\n둥지로 삼을 때도 있다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "在狹窄陰暗的地方才會感到安穩。\n有時也會用訓練家的懷抱\n或是包包代替巢穴。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il se sent à l’aise dans les endroits sombres\net étroits. Il se sert parfois de la poche ou\ndu sac de son Dresseur comme d’un nid.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "An engen, dunklen Orten fühlt es sich wohl.\nManchmal zweckentfremdet es die Brusttasche\noder den Beutel seines Trainers als Nest.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se siente a gusto en lugares angostos y oscuros.\nEn más de una ocasión usa el bolsillo o la\nmochila de su Entrenador a modo de nido.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Si sente a suo agio in luoghi stretti e bui.\nA volte usa le tasche o la Borsa del suo\nAllenatore a mo’ di nido.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It feels relaxed in tight, dark places and has\nbeen known to use its Trainer’s pocket or bag\nas a nest.",
